msgid "Required to be able to reset password if you forget it"
msgstr "Requis pour pouvoir réinitialiser le mot de passe si vous l'oubliez"

msgid "Sign up"
msgstr "Créer un compte"

msgid ""
"Create your private space, then link your Tesla account in a few steps."
msgstr ""
"Créez votre espace privé, puis reliez votre compte Tesla en quelques étapes."

msgid "Already registered?"
msgstr "Déjà inscrit ?"

msgid "Login"
msgstr "Se connecter"

#, python-format
msgid "Partner public key must be served over HTTPS (got %(scheme)s)."
msgstr ""
"La clé publique partenaire doit être servie en HTTPS (schéma reçu : "
"%(scheme)s)."

msgid "Could not read a host from that URL."
msgstr "Impossible de lire un hôte dans cette URL."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Tesla always fetches the public key at https://%(host)s%(path)s — not at an "
"arbitrary path. Host the PEM there (any HTTPS server is fine: nginx, S3, "
"Cloudflare, GitHub Pages, …)."
msgstr ""
"Tesla récupère toujours la clé publique à https://%(host)s%(path)s — pas à "
"un chemin arbitraire. Hébergez le PEM à cette adresse (tout serveur HTTPS "
"convient : nginx, S3, Cloudflare, GitHub Pages, …)."

msgid ""
"Tesla rejects localhost as a partner domain. Use a public HTTPS domain."
msgstr ""
"Tesla refuse localhost comme domaine partenaire. Utilisez un domaine HTTPS "
"public."

#, python-format
msgid "Cannot reach %(url)s: %(err)s"
msgstr "Impossible d’atteindre %(url)s : %(err)s"

#, python-format
msgid "%(url)s → HTTP %(code)s"
msgstr "%(url)s → HTTP %(code)s"

#, python-format
msgid "%(url)s does not contain a valid public key PEM"
msgstr "%(url)s ne contient pas un PEM de clé publique valide"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(url)s is reachable but does not match the local key (%(path)s). Re-upload "
"the file."
msgstr ""
"%(url)s est accessible mais le contenu ne correspond pas à la clé locale "
"(%(path)s). Réuploadez le fichier."

#, python-format
msgid "Public key OK: %(url)s"
msgstr "Clé publique OK : %(url)s"

msgid "Missing Client ID / Secret."
msgstr "Client ID / Secret manquants."

#, python-format
msgid "Partner token failed (%(code)s): %(body)s"
msgstr "Partner token échoué (%(code)s) : %(body)s"

msgid "Missing app settings."
msgstr "Paramètres d’application manquants."

msgid ""
"Tesla rejects localhost as a partner domain. Use a public HTTPS domain (e.g."
" robotcar.example.com)."
msgstr ""
"Tesla refuse localhost comme domaine partenaire. Utilisez un domaine HTTPS "
"public (ex. robotcar.example.com)."

#, python-format
msgid "Public key not reachable by Tesla before register: %(msg)s"
msgstr "Clé publique non accessible par Tesla avant register : %(msg)s"

#, python-format
msgid "Partner register failed (%(code)s): %(body)s"
msgstr "Register partner échoué (%(code)s) : %(body)s"

msgid "Client ID"
msgstr "Client ID"

msgid "Client secret"
msgstr "Client secret"

msgid "OAuth redirect URI"
msgstr "URI de redirection OAuth"

msgid "Fleet API region"
msgstr "Région API Fleet"

msgid ""
"Must match the redirect URI on developer.tesla.com exactly (often "
"http://localhost:8001/oauth/callback for a local install)."
msgstr ""
"Doit correspondre exactement à l’URI de redirection sur developer.tesla.com "
"(souvent http://localhost:8001/oauth/callback en install locale)."

msgid "Europe / Middle East / Africa (recommended for Belgium)"
msgstr "Europe / Moyen-Orient / Afrique (recommandé pour la Belgique)"

msgid "North America / Asia-Pacific (excl. China)"
msgstr "Amérique du Nord / Asie-Pacifique (hors Chine)"

msgid "China"
msgstr "Chine"

msgid "Partner domain or public key URL"
msgstr "Domaine partenaire ou URL de la clé publique"

msgid ""
"Paste a domain (example.com), an origin (https://example.com), or the full "
"public-key URL. Hosting is free choice (nginx, S3, Cloudflare, GitHub Pages,"
" …) but Tesla always fetches /.well-known/appspecific/com.tesla.3p.public-"
"key.pem on that host. Add the same host with https:// as Allowed Origin on "
"developer.tesla.com. Not localhost."
msgstr ""
"Collez un domaine (example.com), une origine (https://example.com) ou l’URL "
"complète de la clé publique. L’hébergement est libre (nginx, S3, Cloudflare,"
" GitHub Pages, …) mais Tesla récupère toujours /.well-"
"known/appspecific/com.tesla.3p.public-key.pem sur cet hôte. Ajoutez le même "
"hôte avec https:// en Allowed Origin sur developer.tesla.com. Pas localhost."

